lse,\\\"evidence_count\\\":6,\\\"primary_quote\\\":\\\"@tinytechfox The second half is the one nobody warns you about. I can vibe code the thing in a weekend now, but getting even 10 people to notice it still eats weeks of my nights.\\\",\\\"verified_badge\\\":\\\"blue\\\"},\\\"evidence\\\":[{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125301081815027774\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125301081815027774\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@tinytechfox The second half is the one nobody warns you about. I can vibe code the thing in a weekend now, but getting even 10 people to notice it still eats weeks of my nights.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"f76eb5eb0d025457448a982d3cea2ee894fc9062c5a1bcec0665fb885aaea133\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@tinytechfox The second half is the one nobody warns you about. I can vibe code the thing in a weekend now, but getting even 10 people to notice it still eats weeks of my nights.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125240044424401092\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125240044424401092\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@alexcooldev Yep. I vibe coded a little couples habit app onto the App Store in evenings. The code was the fast part. The real work, still ongoing, is getting two people to trust it and keep showing up.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"34307bbfa1701e4b9e6f62b222e5e97f7fce848fb6c5ff24f51bb29998a5e14b\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@alexcooldev Yep. I vibe coded a little couples habit app onto the App Store in evenings. The code was the fast part. The real work, still ongoing, is getting two people to trust it and keep showing up.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125253455354749277\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125253455354749277\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@sergeynazarovx 'We already have internal tools' is a positioning gap, not a product flaw, so that cancel is your best data point. My launches spiked then flatlined too. Who's the one person Scoutie is obviously for?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"6e936383d34f2149b52d54424d8560f9ad28a19db282220f22fc2fffa9e3487d\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@sergeynazarovx 'We already have internal tools' is a positioning gap, not a product flaw, so that cancel is your best data point. My launches spiked then flatlined too. Who's the one person Scoutie is obviously for?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2124474050244116951\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2124474050244116951\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@indiekornel Twenty months in and the bill changed. It used to be evenings. This week it was five days on distribution and marketing instead of the apps. Is yours still costing what it did in February?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-22\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"c9898d5d528c67e696bdfc49a2b4ca988e11328f2b51548757f9d44d84cadbf6\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-22T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@indiekornel Twenty months in and the bill changed. It used to be evenings. This week it was five days on distribution and marketing instead of the apps. Is yours still costing what it did in February?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-22\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2124388080912318622\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2124388080912318622\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@Ionkosm Vibe coding a new app most weekends, and yeah, I grab the same kit every time to ship fast. Same defaults, live by Sunday. I keep saying I'll fight the sameness, then I ship anyway.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-22\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"9a33ce25751deb36e7eab2b8da9894c0006babf725151a8e2851b38ce1d65cb4\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-22T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@Ionkosm Vibe coding a new app most weekends, and yeah, I grab the same kit every time to ship fast. Same defaults, live by Sunday. I keep saying I'll fight the sameness, then I ship anyway.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-22\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125285261412360667\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125285261412360667\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@mvanhorn For me it never had a toy phase. I'm 50, can't write a line without Claude, and every model jump like 4.5 just means my stuff finally gets past a blank screen instead of dying in a branch.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"83ccfded7785deec2c29a995f6075277dbffe6f6fa5e0fba8cfcb38517ec76f2\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@mvanhorn For me it never had a toy phase. I'm 50, can't write a line without Claude, and every model jump like 4.5 just means my stuff finally gets past a blank screen instead of dying in a branch.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null}],\\\"source_assertions\\\":[{\\\"source_slug\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"source_name\\\":\\\"Blocked for AI Reply (External)\\\",\\\"classification\\\":\\\"external_confirmed_ai_reply\\\",\\\"list_version\\\":\\\"2026-11-25\\\",\\\"verified\\\":false,\\\"source_evidence_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125301081815027774\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-25T08:26:34.299477\\\"}],\\\"meta\\\":{\\\"disclaimer\\\":\\\"Classification reflects observable behavioral patterns under Policy v1.0.0, not proof of AI authorship or platform rule violation.\\\",\\\"appeal_url\\\":\\\"https://aiblocklist.com/appeals?platform=x\\u0026username=LucaCaponeX\\\"}},{\\\"schema_version\\\":\\\"1.0\\\",\\\"account\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5bdf2c37-a769-4a73-812e-b68a8c424e8a\\\",\\\"platform\\\":\\\"x\\\",\\\"platform_account_id\\\":\\\"171736111\\\",\\\"identity_confidence\\\":\\\"immutable_id\\\",\\\"username\\\":\\\"luisroquette\\\",\\\"public_profile_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/luisroquette\\\",\\\"classification\\\":\\\"under_review\\\",\\\"verification_status\\\":\\\"unverified_external\\\",\\\"confidence_level\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"is_high_impact\\\":false,\\\"policy_version\\\":\\\"v1.0.0\\\",\\\"public_rationale\\\":\\\"External unverified assertion imported from blockedforaireply (listed). 4 canonical public post reference(s) indexed; pending independent AIBlockList human verification.\\\",\\\"last_reviewed_at\\\":null,\\\"re_review_due_at\\\":null,\\\"appeal_status\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"has_source_conflict\\\":false,\\\"evidence_count\\\":4,\\\"primary_quote\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X A delay filters out lazy bots, not bad replies. Spammers will add a sleep(90) by Friday. The tell was never speed, it's the reply that would fit under any post on the timeline. Rank on that and the delay stops mattering.\\\",\\\"verified_badge\\\":\\\"blue\\\"},\\\"evidence\\\":[{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125307559535882519\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125307559535882519\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X A delay filters out lazy bots, not bad replies. Spammers will add a sleep(90) by Friday. The tell was never speed, it's the reply that would fit under any post on the timeline. Rank on that and the delay stops mattering.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"0b9c03217f41f396c210a4d7b09d9e2e4e91cdde9b7f25c41b70ddd2f681a722\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X A delay filters out lazy bots, not bad replies. Spammers will add a sleep(90) by Friday. The tell was never speed, it's the reply that would fit under any post on the timeline. Rank on that and the delay stops mattering.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125308362224959491\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125308362224959491\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@rasbt Battle-tested enterprise code is mostly workarounds for vendors that died years ago. Train on it and you win the race to reproduce the workaround. The moat isn't the code, it's the tickets explaining why it's weird, and nobody has those cleaned up.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"e069210781f507e755db6de9784daa9031b9b78e9ad2fded6f371a6f114315c8\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@rasbt Battle-tested enterprise code is mostly workarounds for vendors that died years ago. Train on it and you win the race to reproduce the workaround. The moat isn't the code, it's the tickets explaining why it's weird, and nobody has those cleaned up.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2124944406125912410\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2124944406125912410\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@GoogleDeepMind Agents designing the circuits is the headline. The real tell is \\\\\\\"up to 10x\\\\\\\" on simulation cost: the bottleneck moved from hardware to search. Same in code: the model isn't the moat, the verifier that says which of 1,000 attempts actually works is.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-23\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"e37eb8246146e29e64676601819a6c5ef63d80a9fb8be26719b5e7bba9bcacaa\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-23T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@GoogleDeepMind Agents designing the circuits is the headline. The real tell is \\\\\\\"up to 10x\\\\\\\" on simulation cost: the bottleneck moved from hardware to search. Same in code: the model isn't the moat, the verifier that says which of 1,000 attempts actually works is.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-23\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125308478424051847\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125308478424051847\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@Lovable The funny part: the tools that let anyone build are exactly why software can finally stop being for everyone. When a custom CRM costs an afternoon, nobody needs to rent the one designed for thousands of companies that aren't theirs.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"f5bf7a966f38d44da207bd1a1b760e09dbdaa9a3bc82b160fe063829cabd1dc6\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@Lovable The funny part: the tools that let anyone build are exactly why software can finally stop being for everyone. When a custom CRM costs an afternoon, nobody needs to rent the one designed for thousands of companies that aren't theirs.\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null}],\\\"source_assertions\\\":[{\\\"source_slug\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"source_name\\\":\\\"Blocked for AI Reply (External)\\\",\\\"classification\\\":\\\"external_confirmed_ai_reply\\\",\\\"list_version\\\":\\\"2026-11-25\\\",\\\"verified\\\":false,\\\"source_evidence_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125307559535882519\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-25T08:26:34.299477\\\"}],\\\"meta\\\":{\\\"disclaimer\\\":\\\"Classification reflects observable behavioral patterns under Policy v1.0.0, not proof of AI authorship or platform rule violation.\\\",\\\"appeal_url\\\":\\\"https://aiblocklist.com/appeals?platform=x\\u0026username=luisroquette\\\"}},{\\\"schema_version\\\":\\\"1.0\\\",\\\"account\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"723961b2-7802-4971-b241-18f667cc1455\\\",\\\"platform\\\":\\\"x\\\",\\\"platform_account_id\\\":\\\"343877206\\\",\\\"identity_confidence\\\":\\\"immutable_id\\\",\\\"username\\\"