se,\\\"source_evidence_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125286270738006343\\\",\\\"updated_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-25T08:26:34.299477\\\"}],\\\"meta\\\":{\\\"disclaimer\\\":\\\"Classification reflects observable behavioral patterns under Policy v1.0.0, not proof of AI authorship or platform rule violation.\\\",\\\"appeal_url\\\":\\\"https://aiblocklist.com/appeals?platform=x\\u0026username=smobilefactory\\\"}},{\\\"schema_version\\\":\\\"1.0\\\",\\\"account\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7681b71d-dc13-4e17-8a3f-fb5818284552\\\",\\\"platform\\\":\\\"x\\\",\\\"platform_account_id\\\":\\\"2075871987965030400\\\",\\\"identity_confidence\\\":\\\"immutable_id\\\",\\\"username\\\":\\\"borgesmathai\\\",\\\"public_profile_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/borgesmathai\\\",\\\"classification\\\":\\\"under_review\\\",\\\"verification_status\\\":\\\"unverified_external\\\",\\\"confidence_level\\\":\\\"low\\\",\\\"is_high_impact\\\":false,\\\"policy_version\\\":\\\"v1.0.0\\\",\\\"public_rationale\\\":\\\"External unverified assertion imported from blockedforaireply (listed). 6 canonical public post reference(s) indexed; pending independent AIBlockList human verification.\\\",\\\"last_reviewed_at\\\":null,\\\"re_review_due_at\\\":null,\\\"appeal_status\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"has_source_conflict\\\":false,\\\"evidence_count\\\":6,\\\"primary_quote\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X a delay is a speed bump, not a filter: spam bots will ship a sleep() by tonight lol. still a good first move, it makes spam cost time. the real signal is whether the reply adds something the post didn't say\\\",\\\"verified_badge\\\":\\\"blue\\\"},\\\"evidence\\\":[{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125326862079668604\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125326862079668604\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X a delay is a speed bump, not a filter: spam bots will ship a sleep() by tonight lol. still a good first move, it makes spam cost time. the real signal is whether the reply adds something the post didn't say\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"204e30d9114f285a4ed839b0c635983bcd2e450220e15aa0284fd87c31172026\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@levelsio @X a delay is a speed bump, not a filter: spam bots will ship a sleep() by tonight lol. still a good first move, it makes spam cost time. the real signal is whether the reply adds something the post didn't say\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125296341324841419\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125296341324841419\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@thsottiaux merging Chat and Work is where permissions get interesting: in chat a bad answer costs a reread, in work a bad action costs a rollback. will Work show what each action touched and let me undo it in the same place, or does undo stay manual?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"3391ff393d29bd0d67efbcc0f876896b625b863b6c5da8fefada1a0277bfda35\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@thsottiaux merging Chat and Work is where permissions get interesting: in chat a bad answer costs a reread, in work a bad action costs a rollback. will Work show what each action touched and let me undo it in the same place, or does undo stay manual?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125308764362608698\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125308764362608698\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@RodrigoHajime o difícil é a fronteira: quem decide o que é rotina? se for o próprio agente classificando o PR, o humano só vê o que ele escolheu mostrar. eu liberaria pelo custo de reverter: volta com um revert, ok; migração e regra de negócio, não. dá pra configurar assim?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"d83a7275d185bddd0182e8c87e7277a4eee8696580b5614d9f631ba732f71cd1\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@RodrigoHajime o difícil é a fronteira: quem decide o que é rotina? se for o próprio agente classificando o PR, o humano só vê o que ele escolheu mostrar. eu liberaria pelo custo de reverter: volta com um revert, ok; migração e regra de negócio, não. dá pra configurar assim?\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125326705577615835\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125326705577615835\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@granatowp @opentelemetry @tucanosh trace em OTLP é o que dá sentido ao checkbox de próximos passos: antes de marcar e deixar o agente seguir, tu vê o que ele já fez. aprovar sem visibilidade é HITL de fachada; com trace o humano pelo menos sabe o que tá aprovando\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"63e53ff873e3ffc06d055350aa26be691a95eebcc5c786c29ddd035676fd7f37\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@granatowp @opentelemetry @tucanosh trace em OTLP é o que dá sentido ao checkbox de próximos passos: antes de marcar e deixar o agente seguir, tu vê o que ele já fez. aprovar sem visibilidade é HITL de fachada; com trace o humano pelo menos sabe o que tá aprovando\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125296177830601176\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125296177830601176\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@LucasCostaAT a pergunta que o regulador inglês deixa no ar: quando o agente renova o seguro errado, quem responde, o app ou o usuário que autorizou uma vez lá atrás? o PL 2338 vai por grau de risco, e agente que mexe com dinheiro devia contar pelo custo de desfazer, não pelo de fazer\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\"},\\\"content_hash_sha256\\\":\\\"6d8d5524164195ec0b583206513058b85b38990904ccbdbf6af4f18419574059\\\",\\\"source_deleted\\\":false,\\\"collected_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\\\",\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@LucasCostaAT a pergunta que o regulador inglês deixa no ar: quando o agente renova o seguro errado, quem responde, o app ou o usuário que autorizou uma vez lá atrás? o PL 2338 vai por grau de risco, e agente que mexe com dinheiro devia contar pelo custo de desfazer, não pelo de fazer\\\",\\\"post_date\\\":\\\"2026-11-24\\\",\\\"response_text\\\":null},{\\\"public_post_url\\\":\\\"https://x.com/i/status/2125307147647107510\\\",\\\"platform_post_id\\\":\\\"2125307147647107510\\\",\\\"signal_type\\\":\\\"external_reported_reply\\\",\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"upstream_source\\\":\\\"blockedforaireply\\\",\\\"reply_status\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"verified_by_aiblocklist\\\":false,\\\"post_text\\\":\\\"@ricarduset fase 1: instala e acha que é gênio. fase 2: desanima. fase 3: configura tudo e a mágica acontece. fase 4: descobre que a mágica também tem permissão pra apagar coisa ksjsk