_text\":\"@bl888m_eth the funny part is when both sides are bots. two agents stuck in a phone tree together\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-11\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"5df105aac1fa9aa84d0ac903f83076528a93dc7c3504f2315acc1c07de1d0547\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-11T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@bl888m_eth the funny part is when both sides are bots. two agents stuck in a phone tree together\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-11\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2121566472887529919\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2121566472887529919\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@vaibhavbalkundi Small correction: it's not usage up 7%, it's the allowance. Same $30, ~7% more room. The question is whether that 7% covers the video that now lands in the same pool\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-14\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"afebdc2a440d0f205b85317bb80a2a86285695d2239d5884be79fea2e4602f10\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-14T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@vaibhavbalkundi Small correction: it's not usage up 7%, it's the allowance. Same $30, ~7% more room. The question is whether that 7% covers the video that now lands in the same pool\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-14\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2122762515721732281\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2122762515721732281\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@thekuchh @grok @bot Could be a trial, could be the router sending it somewhere else. Elon just said only \\\"some trials behind the scenes,\\\" so you might actually be one of them. Shorter in a good way or a bad way?\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-17\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"f42f0aecf5cc22e142b11d37d9f7d3c7d886517df68ec8a561b7d4e