List human verification.\",\"last_reviewed_at\":null,\"re_review_due_at\":null,\"appeal_status\":\"none\",\"has_source_conflict\":false,\"evidence_count\":6,\"primary_quote\":\"@SmallwoodAl_ The weekend Claude Code user walking into a locked-down chatbot on Monday is the retention risk I'd worry about first. The best analysts notice that gap before IT does.\",\"verified_badge\":\"blue\"},\"evidence\":[{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2125257348507639892\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2125257348507639892\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@SmallwoodAl_ The weekend Claude Code user walking into a locked-down chatbot on Monday is the retention risk I'd worry about first. The best analysts notice that gap before IT does.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"867707945e2a485d5d7cc11d8add465882a487ffb23a26d7e29eb32ba30918cf\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@SmallwoodAl_ The weekend Claude Code user walking into a locked-down chatbot on Monday is the retention risk I'd worry about first. The best analysts notice that gap before IT does.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2125256908030537843\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2125256908030537843\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@ayesha_fatiima Founders going back to building says a lot about where the fun problems are right now. When the tools move this fast, shipping beats managing.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"941c8abe6c058ad650953caa6435067f95d2a3c0e14fd1c90706c66f25928109\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@ayesha_fatiima Founders going back to building says a lot about where the fun problems are right now. When the tools move this fast, shipping beats managing.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2125255997321306617\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2125255997321306617\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@IntuitMachine The skill that carries over is knowing which step to distrust. A good centaur rechecks the lemma the model sounded most sure about.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"26ab594602ced93e0b51a7445c90263dbdbdf4d00496a9f2938feecc3160fc44\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@IntuitMachine The skill that carries over is knowing which step to distrust. A good centaur rechecks the lemma the model sounded most sure about.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2125255102885933158\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2125255102885933158\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_reply\",\"metrics\":{\"upstream_source\":\"blockedforaireply\",\"reply_status\":\"ok\",\"verified_by_aiblocklist\":false,\"post_text\":\"@liran_tal Silent no-ops are the worst failure a scheduled job can have. I'd set up a 'didn't run' alert before any 'ran and failed' one.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\"},\"content_hash_sha256\":\"2cd7b3feca778d186a9fc1c3705ee9e6499003694f0be77b3fce0832f6183d07\",\"source_deleted\":false,\"collected_at\":\"2026-11-24T00:00:00\",\"post_text\":\"@liran_tal Silent no-ops are the worst failure a scheduled job can have. I'd set up a 'didn't run' alert before any 'ran and failed' one.\",\"post_date\":\"2026-11-24\",\"response_text\":null},{\"public_post_url\":\"https://x.com/i/status/2125254660441436415\",\"platform_post_id\":\"2125254660441436415\",\"signal_type\":\"external_reported_